      "name": "Setup and operation",
      "id": "c033014e-2f2f-4660-a775-000000000023",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -410
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shopify product keywords\nConnect a Shopify store, your Reach Dog header credential, PostgreSQL and Google Sheets. In Configuration enter the trusted API origin, a stable billing account label, a daily cap and the spreadsheet ID. Install the SQL from this repository before enabling the trigger. Create Keywords and Excluded tabs using the headers in the README. Each new product requests search phrases and search volume. The workflow reserves two parameter prices against the current UTC admission day before sending the paid request. If the remaining allowance is too small, the Keywords tab records a skip. A missing receipt or interrupted execution can leave a reservation held. Check the original execution and payment receipt before taking recovery action.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 550
      }
    },
